  "details": "# Issue:\nIn-game your World \"Favorites\" are being called Playlists, e.g. \"Add To Playlist\", this is even the case for UI 2.0. On the Website they are called Favorites though, e.g. \"Add to Favorties\".\nThis seems a bit inconsistent and I could see it being confusing for a few people.\n# Suggestion:\n\"Favorite Worlds\" should be changed \"World Playlists\" to be consistent with the in-game UI.\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see them being called two different things on the Website and in-game:",
